# Default validation messages, as RDF.
#
# What this file is: the wording shown for a constraint violation when the shape's
# author wrote no `sh:message` in the reader's language. One resource per SHACL
# constraint component, one `sh:message` literal per language. It is data, not code:
# a language is added by supplying more triples (`useMetadataForm({ messages })`),
# never by editing the library.
#
# Why `sh:message` on the component. SHACL defines `sh:message` as the wording of
# the results a constraint produces (SHACL §2.1.5: the values are copied into the
# results' `sh:resultMessage`), and lets SHACL-SPARQL constraints and
# component validators declare one too (§5.1, §6.2.2).
# A constraint component's message is that same statement one level up: "results
# this component produces read like this, unless the shape says otherwise". No term
# is minted in a W3C namespace. The alternatives said something else: `rdfs:comment`
# and `skos:definition` describe the COMPONENT, not the error a reader sees.
# The W3C `shacl.ttl` cannot serve as this data: it carries `@en` only and describes
# components. Reading `sh:message` on a component is our convention, not a SHACL rule.
#
# `sh:ConstraintComponent` itself (the class of all components) holds the message
# for any component this file does not name.
#
# Language: Spanish.

@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

sh:MinCountConstraintComponent sh:message "Este campo es obligatorio"@es .
sh:MaxCountConstraintComponent sh:message "Demasiados valores"@es .
sh:DatatypeConstraintComponent sh:message "Tipo de valor no válido"@es .
sh:NodeKindConstraintComponent sh:message "Clase de valor no válida"@es .
sh:PatternConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no coincide con el patrón requerido"@es .
sh:MinLengthConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor es demasiado corto"@es .
sh:MaxLengthConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor es demasiado largo"@es .
sh:ClassConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no es del tipo esperado"@es .
sh:InConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no es una opción permitida"@es .
sh:NodeConstraintComponent sh:message "Faltan datos en esta sección"@es .
sh:PropertyConstraintComponent sh:message "Hay datos no válidos en esta propiedad"@es .
sh:QualifiedValueShapeConstraintComponent sh:message "Algunos valores no son los esperados aquí"@es .
sh:QualifiedMinCountConstraintComponent sh:message "No hay suficientes valores que cumplan lo esperado"@es .
sh:QualifiedMaxCountConstraintComponent sh:message "Hay demasiados valores que cumplen lo esperado"@es .
sh:ReifierShapeConstraintComponent sh:message "Faltan datos sobre esta declaración"@es .
sh:AndConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no cumple todos los requisitos"@es .
sh:OrConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no cumple ninguna de las alternativas permitidas"@es .
sh:XoneConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor debe cumplir exactamente una de las alternativas"@es .
sh:NotConstraintComponent sh:message "Este valor no está permitido aquí"@es .
sh:IfConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no cumple el requisito que se aplica aquí"@es .
sh:MinInclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor es demasiado pequeño"@es .
sh:MinExclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor es demasiado pequeño"@es .
sh:MaxInclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor es demasiado grande"@es .
sh:MaxExclusiveConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor es demasiado grande"@es .
sh:LanguageInConstraintComponent sh:message "Este idioma no está permitido"@es .
sh:UniqueLangConstraintComponent sh:message "Solo se permite un valor por idioma"@es .
sh:EqualsConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor debe coincidir con el del campo relacionado"@es .
sh:DisjointConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor debe ser distinto del campo relacionado"@es .
sh:LessThanConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor debe ser menor que el del campo relacionado"@es .
sh:LessThanOrEqualsConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor debe ser menor o igual que el del campo relacionado"@es .
sh:HasValueConstraintComponent sh:message "Falta un valor obligatorio"@es .
sh:ClosedConstraintComponent sh:message "Esta propiedad no está permitida aquí"@es .
sh:SPARQLConstraintComponent sh:message "El valor no cumple un requisito personalizado"@es .
sh:ConstraintComponent sh:message "Valor no válido"@es .
